.TH HOPASH-LOGS 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.1" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-logs \- Follow the live Core Log stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash logs\fR <\fB\-\-follow\fR> [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Follow the live Core Log stream
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-follow\fR
Continue streaming until interrupted
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
